---
import { currentCourseProfile } from '@amat19/course-content'; import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---
<AppLayout title="Home"><section class="page-width page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Finite mathematics · local-first concept lab</p><h1 class="display-title">See the rule, not just the answer.</h1><p class="lede">AMAT 19 Study Lab turns logic, probability, finance, matrices and optimization into inspectable mathematical objects. Deterministic engines produce the result; the learning layer exposes the structure and legal steps behind it.</p></section><section class="page-width" aria-labelledby="modules-heading"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Course map</p><h2 id="modules-heading">Study by module</h2></div><a href="/course">Open full roadmap →</a></div><div class="route-grid">{currentCourseProfile.modules.map(module=><a class="route-link" href={module.href}><span><strong>{module.title}</strong><small>{module.description}</small></span><span class="status-pill">{module.status==='implemented'?'Live':module.status}</span></a>)}</div></section><section class="page-width module-section" aria-labelledby="practice-heading"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Cross-domain retrieval</p><h2 id="practice-heading">Practice after you learn the tool</h2></div></div><div class="route-grid"><a class="route-link" href="/practice"><span><strong>Mixed Practice</strong><small>Generated course-aligned questions with immediate deterministic feedback and direct repair links.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="route-link" href="/exam"><span><strong>Mixed Course Check</strong><small>Hide feedback until submission and see what you can solve independently.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section><section class="page-width feature-band" aria-labelledby="principles-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">How the app teaches</p><h2 id="principles-heading">Explain → visualize → manipulate → practice → check</h2></div><div class="feature-band__grid"><p><strong>Deterministic first.</strong> Logic rules, exact fractions, matrix operations and optimization decisions do not depend on an AI model.</p><p><strong>Local first.</strong> Drafts and progress stay in this browser unless explicitly exported.</p><p><strong>Course aware.</strong> Current-course requirements and older supplemental depth are not silently mixed together.</p></div></section></AppLayout>
